</requirement>
<requirement>
The `fs.file.mLang` member of the `FileSettings` struct should be a valid `Standards::Language` enum value. This is because the language is used to determine which checks to perform on the file.
</requirement>
<requirement>
The `fs.standard` member should be a valid C or C++ standard string (e.g., "c++11", "c99"). This is because an invalid standard will cause the check to fail.
</requirement>
<requirement>
The `fs.platformType` member should be a valid `Platform::Type` enum value. This is because the platform is used to determine how to parse the code.
</requirement>

</requirements>

